{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgQcb27RZdso5T8dfPort","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Everything is ready to write to Figma. Here is the write step. Nothing is written until you say yes.\n\n**What the board answers:** how does a Fernhouse customer start a return in the app today?\n**What it needs to show:** product and design can follow every screen from the order list to the QR confirmation, and can see where the 30-day limit sends a customer to Contact support.\n\n**What a reader should see, in order:**\n- **First:** the highlighted *Within 30 days of delivery?* check, which decides whether a return can start at all.\n- **Next:** the two paths after a reason is picked, drop-off point or courier pickup, both ending at the QR confirmation.\n- **Last, can wait:** the source line, which notes that the screenshots and returns doc weren't supplied and that the free pickup over €100 is a proposal under review.\n\n**Write details:**\n- **Target:** a new FigJam file named \"Fernhouse: start a return\" in the **<figma-plan-1>** plan (Pro, Full seat)\n- **What gets drawn:** one board with a title, a subtitle, three shaded sections, 9 nodes, 9 labelled arrows, a key and the source line. Nothing is added beside the diagram.\n- **Figma calls:** 3. One creates the file, one draws the board, and one reads it back to check it against the model.\n- **To undo:** delete the new file. No existing file is touched, including `<test-file-key>`.\n\nShall I write it?"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":472,"cache_read_input_tokens":45533,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":472},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"